{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gmhmtjhpHl1795075774.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB今日（19日）迎來59周年台慶大日子，大型特備節目《萬千星輝賀台慶》將於今晚7時許在電視廣播城隆重舉行，並由翡翠台全程現場直播。今年台慶陣容鼎盛，除了集結全台逾200位藝員及歌手施展渾身解數帶來連場精彩表演外，更重磅邀得三屆視帝羅嘉良及許志安擔任特別嘉賓，勢必將全晚氣氛推向高峰。</p><p></p><p>大會司儀陣容同樣星光熠熠，由汪明荃領軍，聯同林溥來、朱凱婷、周奕瑋、洪永城、黃翠如、陸浩明、麥美恩、鄭衍峰、林秀怡、孔德賢及潘靜文合共12位主持坐鎮全場。除了連串歌舞及特備演出外，每年備受矚目的台慶大抽獎亦已準備就緒，獎金獎品相當豐富，與全港觀眾一齊熱鬧歡度TVB 59歲生日派對。</p><p></p><p><strong>PART 1 OPENING</strong></p><p>張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛、吳偉豪、朱敏瀚、陳曉華、馬貫東、劉佩玥、羅天宇、黃庭鋒等率領逾80藝員齊集6號幹線 (中九龍繞道—九龍灣段)揭開台慶序幕。 三屆視帝羅嘉良（撈家）孖關嘉敏、游嘉欣、李海銅、鍾柔美、劉芷君、羅天宇及劉倬昕等新生代藝人再現《難兄難弟》精彩場面，齊齊唱《奇哥》！</p><p><p><img alt=\"f4eeefe5-4854-4a2e-9332-c038a3785cd2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gmIqD15wPb1795089876.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"227dd646-e871-42a5-8c4d-bdf6b70e0aa0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WDl0tVWQX01795089891.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3cbd4c11-89ec-4486-82b6-1110484c3ee0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KWk4xJlacQ1795089907.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6068.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265FWLOFD7Ct1795090860.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6177.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EknaOHYOIk1795090927.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6047.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u1BGZJoSkb1795090953.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><strong>PART 2 東張女神盃</strong></p><p>6位東張女神包括李旻芳、梁敏巧、黎寬怡、甘詠寧、何沛珈、陳庭欣手持咪進行400米跑步比賽，最終李旻芳奪得第一名，何沛珈包尾！</p><p><p><img alt=\"52cf7ef7-fca3-410d-982e-3e04129798f8.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ElsYQqQwqk1795092246.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8c4f149e-8776-49cb-93b7-6c1fe1fe9a02.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hlfYVGgEOl1795092261.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5370b88d-24e8-42a9-9a1d-15d84857b7ab.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oaz82A9gWN1795091948.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"be61462e-a9b0-4680-b493-2486dd61fba5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264DT6kQ3oin1795091963.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><strong>PART 3 炫舞女王</strong></p><p>陳煒、陳敏之、姚子羚及傅嘉莉帶領全台近30位女藝人大跳特跳！</p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7018.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026efmpMkalYG1795093396.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6900.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265wfHhmH4701795093368.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6769.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yycVegYCIq1795093303.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6725.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262jhOA1ovgR1795093278.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><strong>PART4 中年勁歌 &amp; MYNT</strong></p><p>肥媽、譚輝智、張與辰、黃博、尹景順、許雲妮、鄭家聲、吳亦偉、尤淑情、許美琪、蔡宓婕與一班小朋友共同帶來一系列勁歌金曲！ 另外，還有女團 MYNT 首次唱跳她們的第三首作品！</p><p><p><img alt=\"ddb40c02-435e-4f2d-a977-a3ab5ba2f464.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xuCORPnhre1795094263.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"df271c6d-47ee-4437-babc-144c836d2e33.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uv0pdLVPgA1795094270.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7145.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eUQg74QNAs1795094483.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7189.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269AyeXir4nC1795094494.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7254.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uRtrRWIEoa1795094505.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7289.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026j6SXke7KQw1795094514.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7322.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DKd10I1sfA1795094524.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7333.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pKAYm6g45G1795094555.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7431.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264OFH1zpHLq1795094572.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><strong>Part 5 台慶喎！有嘢唔見咗！</strong></p><p></p><p>由陳豪、龔嘉欣、譚俊彥、蕭正楠、張曦雯組成的 Team A，對戰由馬國明、高海寧、馬貫東、羅子溢、賴慰玲組成的 Team B。 最終陳豪隊豪贏18萬大獎，馬國明隊惜敗收價值逾11萬獎品。<br/></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7606.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZEWs0kDjjf1795095475.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7540.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026veXBxi225w1795095494.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7517.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267SP4DYt3Wt1795095500.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><strong>Part6 極速狂奔Speed and Stunt</strong></p><p><br/>視帝張振朗聯同劉穎鏇（Tiffany）、朱敏瀚及周嘉洛，上演緊張刺激的高難度動作重頭戲「極速狂奔Speed and Stunt」，將全場氣氛推至另一高峰！<br/><br/>劉穎鏇親身上陣做出凌空鉸剪腳等高難度動作，動作自然流暢，盡顯打女本色！振朗型爆飛車，並挑戰多個驚險特技動作，令觀眾拍爛手掌！四人熱血沸騰的演出，亦是向一眾辛苦付出的幕後動作演員及特技人致敬。</p><p><p><img alt=\"7a8dc7af-b6c5-4ca8-87c4-f5f5a23bd24b.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260E0YzkLKyJ1795096452.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a63b9875-bb42-417e-9af5-e2e487617932.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026e8q6nPcg361795096463.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7692.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T3bLfxA0451795096556.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7744.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264OjwCAs22m1795096582.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D7845.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026A7dg7dPsdj1795096621.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:29.031350+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":977,"images":32,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.390311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:48.605642+00:00","content_hash":"2b6969ada544c75c5c0b09750c8cf0a58d5adaca933881dc4bb77337fc67ffe6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:29.031350+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}